# a .game that says every key a .game may say.
name thing
author Ada
words ~/ignored.txt
exclude vendor/
omit dist/
stack puzzlemouth main
stack crush v0.98.1 theirs
patches shared/patches
patches ./other/patches/
needs CONTACT a name and email the providers can reach
needs REGION where it runs
sweep allow README.md emails
sweep allow README.md author word
lint width 72
lint allow a.md width
lint allow b.md rows paragraph
cover 90
cover allow cmd/thing/main.go needs a real terminal
rapid checks 1000
target mocks . :: go run example.invalid/mockgen -destination x.go
target mocks ~/there :: ~/bin/step two
target quick :: go build
run known . :: go run ./cmd/thing known
